# Core Infrastructure Environment Variables

# Cloudflare Tunnel Token (obtain from Cloudflare Zero Trust Dashboard -> Networks -> Tunnels)
# Or create via CLI: `cloudflared tunnel token <tunnel-name>`
TUNNEL_TOKEN=eyJhIjoi...

# New Relic Ingest License Key (used by bootstrap/setup-newrelic.sh and CI to configure host agent)
# Obtain from New Relic (one.newrelic.com -> API keys -> Key type: INGEST - LICENSE)
NEW_RELIC_LICENSE_KEY=...
